      "writtenOn": "2025-07-02T16:26:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is not required by the CDD. It is only required for devices that support the Telephony HAL version \u003e 1.1 (IIRC) and/or comply with the VSR. That said, we haven\u0027t found a real device that fits in this category and sought Android certification in as long as I can remember. @Mia is your device not supporting the Radio HAL and not bound by the VSR?",
      "parentUuid": "2bc27368_cbee8228",
      "revId": "cd87e53a2dd340ef458a86c0f70846170a1380bd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
